WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:01.870
- Christie, you posted this on Instagram

00:00:01.870 --> 00:00:02.710
last month.

00:00:02.710 --> 00:00:04.570
It goes against my better judgment

00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:06.825
to acknowledge haters
and conspiracy theorists

00:00:06.825 --> 00:00:08.843
but because this involves
my precious daughter

00:00:08.843 --> 00:00:10.900
I'm setting the record straight.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:13.620
So tell us what needed to be set straight,

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:15.000
other than your bones that were broken,

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.523
and why are people meeting?

00:00:17.476 --> 00:00:18.309
- I, what I mean

00:00:18.309 --> 00:00:20.280
- They thought that this was a plan

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:21.113
- Yeah

00:00:21.113 --> 00:00:22.550
- First of all, you'd be
the mother of the year

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:23.980
to break bones
(audience applause)

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:27.310
to get your daughter, like, if that's true

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:29.712
get it.

00:00:29.712 --> 00:00:33.290
- Well, no, they thought,
this person thought,

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:35.920
that Dancing with the
Stars, this amazing show

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:37.450
that's been on on all these years

00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:40.700
is going to lie, that
Cedars Sinai is going to lie

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:44.420
and go along with it, I
mean its so ridiculous

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:45.960
- Doesn't it make just so mad?

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:48.020
- Well at first I wasn't
even going to respond,

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:49.990
but you know what, like any mom out there

00:00:49.990 --> 00:00:53.014
when it's your child, you
get a little riled up.

00:00:53.014 --> 00:00:55.930
It's just indicative of
what's going on right now.

00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:57.340
I just feel like in America,

00:00:57.340 --> 00:00:59.820
we just need to love each other more

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:02.399
(audience applause)

00:01:02.399 --> 00:01:05.323
- I literally have a tattoo
that says love them more.

00:01:05.323 --> 00:01:07.740
Because I feel like,
that's from childhood,

00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:09.523
somebody said that
because people were mean,

00:01:09.523 --> 00:01:11.490
and I was like why are people so mean

00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:12.540
and I asked, and I was at church,

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:15.090
and somebody, a really cool
pastor was like, you know

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:17.370
people who weren't loved
enough, that's why they're mean

00:01:17.370 --> 00:01:18.930
so you need to love them more,

00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:21.860
because they don't even know
how to reciprocate the feeling,

00:01:21.860 --> 00:01:23.010
or feel it, or you know.

00:01:23.010 --> 00:01:26.137
So it is true, love really
does heal a lot of things.

